      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4．化简：",
        "а）$(2p-5)^2+(2p+5)^2$；　б）$\\left(2a+\\frac14\\right)^2-\\left(2a-\\frac14\\right)^2$；",
        "в）$(6-y)^2-(y+6)(y-6)$；",
        "г）$(x^2-4)^2-(x+2)(x-2)(x^2+4)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "5",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5．分解因式：",
        "а）$8ab+12bc$；　б）$15ax-20ay$；　в）$x^2-x$；",
        "г）$2y^3+y^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "6",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "6．设 $A=x-y$，$B=y-x$．",
        "а）证明：式 $A$ 与 $B$ 符号相反，即它们的和恒等于零；",
        "б）证明：式 $A^2$ 与 $B^2$ 恒等；",
        "в）证明：式 $A^3$ 与 $B^3$ 符号相反．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "7",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "7．当变量取什么值时，下列分式没有意义？",
        "а）$\\frac{2c}{c-14}$；　б）$\\frac{3x-1}{20x+10}$；　в）$\\frac{a^2-9}{3a-1}$；",
        "г）$\\frac{x+10}{x(x-3)}$；　д）$\\frac{y+4}{y^2-6y}$；　е）$\\frac{b^2-1}{25b^2-4}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "8",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "8．找出下列各式的定义域：",
        "а）$x^2-8x+9$；　б）$\\frac1{6x-3}$；　в）$\\frac{3x-6}{10}$；",
        "г）$\\frac{x^3-8}{4x^2-1}$；　д）$\\frac{x-5}{x^2+25}$；　е）$\\frac{5x-1}{25x^2-5x}$．"
      ]
    }
  ]
